menu "Gaijin diagnostics"

config GAIJIN_USB_EARLYCON
    bool "Enable best-effort early Linux USB logging"
    default n
    help
        Add the USB earlycon argument to the Linux command line. Output is
        dropped when the USB FIFO is full so boot never waits for a reader.
        Keep disabled for release packages; normal kernel logging and the
        USB login shell remain available without this option.

endmenu
